###
### CONVERSATIONS ENDPOINTS
###

### GET conversations by company ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/companies/1/conversations

### GET conversation by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/conversations/1

### POST create conversation
POST http://localhost:3000/api/companies/1/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_phone": "593987111222",
  "status": "open",
  "metadata": {}
}

### POST create conversation with metadata
POST http://localhost:3000/api/companies/1/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_phone": "+593987123456",
  "status": "open",
  "metadata": {
    "source": "whatsapp",
    "agent": "bot"
  }
}

### PUT update conversation
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/conversations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "closed",
  "metadata": {
    "note": "Usuario atendido",
    "closed_by": "agent"
  }
}

### PUT update conversation status only
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/conversations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pending"
}

